{"parse":{"title":"Waters in Full Splendor","pageid":491565,"revid":2189652,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Waters in Full Splendor</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f4/Constellation_Waters_in_Full_Splendor.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928030637\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Waters in Full Splendor\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f4/Constellation_Waters_in_Full_Splendor.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928030637\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f4/Constellation_Waters_in_Full_Splendor.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928030637 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f4/Constellation_Waters_in_Full_Splendor.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928030637 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Waters in Full Splendor\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Waters_in_Full_Splendor.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Waters in Full Splendor.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vodyanitsa\" title=\"Vodyanitsa\">Vodyanitsa</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Echoes_That_Pierce_the_Snow\" title=\"Echoes That Pierce the Snow\">Echoes That Pierce the Snow</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Each time Vodyanitsa triggers the healing effect of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Song of Ages Past</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Rechitativ: Sonorous Dawn</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Reveals her true Water Imp form, dealing <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>AoE Hydro DMG</b></span> and gaining the Song of Ages Past effect: While this effect is active, Vodyanitsa summons the ancientHorn of Spring's Call, periodically moving closer to an opponent in a swift movement to attack them, dealing <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro DMG</b></span>.<br />The above two types of attacks will also decrease the <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro RES</b></span> and <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo RES</b></span> of opponents hit. Additionally, while the Song of Ages Past effect is active, the party's active character gains increased resistance to interruption and periodically regenerates HP based on Vodyanitsa's Max HP.</span></span></span>, it also increases the ATK of all nearby party members by 0.8% of her Max HP for 5s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Waters in Full Splendor</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Vodyanitsa\" title=\"Vodyanitsa\">Vodyanitsa</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_1_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 1 Constellation\">Level 1 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWaters_in_Full_Splendor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Waters in Full Splendor</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">聚光灯下的水华</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Jùguāngdēng Xià de Shuǐhuá</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Water Blossom Under the Spotlight</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聚光燈下的水華</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Jùguāngdēng Xià de Shuǐhuá</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">脚光に咲く水の花</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">조명</span> <span lang=\"ko\">아래</span> <span lang=\"ko\">물빛</span><br /><small><i>Jomyeong Arae Mulbit</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Aguas esplendorosas</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Eaux dans toute leur splendeur</td><td>Waters in Their Full Splendor</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Воды</span> <span lang=\"ru\">во</span> <span lang=\"ru\">всём</span> <span lang=\"ru\">великолепии</span><br /><small><i>Vody vo vsyom velikolepii</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Waters in Full Splendor</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Bọt Nước Dưới Ánh Đèn</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Wasser im Rampenlicht</td><td>Water in the Spotlight</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Waters in Full Splendor</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td><span lang=\"pt\">Á</span>guas Esplendorosas</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td><span lang=\"tr\">İ</span>hti<span lang=\"tr\">ş</span>aml<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span> Sular</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Gloria assoluta delle acque</td><td>